Partial #12 (gqf2008/brewfs)

Fourth slice: move FsStatsSnapshot (struct + derived metrics impl) and the
ratio helper (~234 lines) into src/vfs/stats_snapshot.rs, re-exported
from stats.rs so existing callers keep working. Pure code motion — no
behavior change; stats tests pass.
